{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=member_1","headline":"石湖春晓 · 石湖客","name":"石湖春晓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖光潋滟晓烟轻，\n柳外莺啼一两声。\n最是一年春好处，\n石湖波上踏青行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"石湖客","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/member_1.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=member_1","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七绝","abstract":"收录于选自《石湖诗社社课习作》（2024）","citation":"石湖客自注"}